[statement]
A provider of a name at no version is chosen for it only if it states a
priority above 0. Without one, apk refuses, asking for a provider to be
named.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x

[request]
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   x (virtual):
|     note: please select one of the 'provided by'
|           packages explicitly
|     provided by: p1
|     required by: world[x]
refused
